# argument                       |   type         |  require?   |   default
# ....................................................................................................
output                           |   string       |  optional   |   valor_splines_[SAMPLE]_[PARAM]_[BEAM]_[DET].root
variations                       |   string       |  mandatory  |   - # For SBN: $VALOR_DUNE/src/macros/contrib/steve/sbn_universe_variations_from_mastbaum.txt
config                           |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
systematic                       |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
sample                           |   string       |  optional   |   numuCCincl
detector                         |   string       |  optional   |   sbn_nd
beam                             |   string       |  optional   |   BNB_FHC
spectra-write-opt                |   string       |  optional   |   pdfts_rf
store-spectra,discard-spectra    |   boolean_list |  optional   |   discard-spectra
save-modelist,dont-save-modelist |   boolean_list |  optional   |   dont-save-modelist
